    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires response times below 2 seconds for common queries, high availability during business hours, resilience to seasonal peak loads, API integration with the firm's production tools, and hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must integrate with accounting-production software, payroll software, document management / GED, and electronic-invoicing / dematerialisation environment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the firm's current technology stack, what architecture would you propose to meet these requirements and are there any potential technical risks or limitations?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the firm's company context at Faber IA, you propose an architecture that leverages the firm's Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client requirements for response times below 2 seconds for common queries, the firm's can utilize our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform orchestration layer and vector store to optimize query performance. the firm's median latency is 1.3 seconds, and the firm's p95 latency is below 2.5 seconds, which aligns with The client expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For high availability during business hours and resilience to seasonal peak loads, our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform architecture can scale horizontally, allowing the firm's to size capacity for seasonal peak loads. the firm's also have built-in monitoring, logging, and observability features to ensure the firm's can quickly respond to any issues that may arise." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the API integration requirements, the firm's API-first approach (REST + webhook) with documented APIs will enable seamless integration with the firm's production tools, including accounting-production software, payroll software, document management / GED, and electronic-invoicing / dematerialisation environment. the firm's business tool integration capabilities, facilitated by the firm's delivery partner Ligeo Conseil, can provide connectors and adapters for these systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding hosting on sovereign infrastructure, the firm's can offer hosting on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, EU-only, and renewable-powered, meeting the client's sovereignty requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, there are potential technical risks or limitations to consider." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "One limitation is that the firm's model options may have lower raw performance on complex generative tasks, particularly if the firm's choose the Sovereign European open-weight model." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, while our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform is model-agnostic, the choice of model may impact performance and latency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Another risk is ensuring seamless integration with the various systems required by the client, which may require additional development and testing efforts." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

