        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's certifications, GDPR instruments, AI security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with the EU regulatory frameworks (GDPR, EU AI Act, RGS, SecNumCloud, NIS2) as of 2024, how can our company's ensure compliance with these requirements and what are the potential security risks?" ;
