    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Security & Compliance Agent for our company's, I can confirm that our company's has obtained ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of our company's services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "ISO 27001 certification demonstrates our company's commitment to information security management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's hold an ISO 27701 certification, which is an extension for privacy information management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with GDPR requirements, our company's have implemented various data protection measures, including encryption in transit using TLS 1.3, encryption at rest using AES-256, and key management on the EU-based infrastructure. our company's also employ strict partitioning of client files with logical isolation per client and per mission, as well as access controls that prevent any cross-client circulation of data. our company's use of pseudonymisation and data minimisation further enhances the protection of sensitive information. our company's configurable retention policy is aligned with legal archival obligations, and our company's have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed to oversee our company's data protection practices. our company's maintain a data processing register and have a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) available, which aligns with GDPR Article 28." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of security controls, our company's follow a secure Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC) that includes code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing conducted by an external provider of equivalent CREST level. our company's also have vulnerability management practices in place, including remediation SLAs by severity, and an incident response plan that includes detection, notification, and remediation, with a 72-hour GDPR breach-notification workflow. our company's experience with the EU regulatory frameworks, including GDPR, is demonstrated through our company's work with clients bound by professional secrecy, such as national professional orders. our company's are familiar with the anti-money-laundering framework (LCB-FT) and understand the importance of not undermining a firm's reporting obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the client's requirements for strict partitioning of client files and no leakage of data between the client's, our company's system ensures that the client's data is isolated and access-controlled. our company's use role-based access control (RBAC) and audit logging to monitor all system activity, which helps in detecting and responding to any potential security incidents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these measures, the potential security risks are mitigated but not entirely eliminated." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Risks could arise from unforeseen vulnerabilities in our company's systems or from human error." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, with our company's robust security controls, regular testing, and compliance framework, our company's are well-equipped to manage and minimize Risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It's worth noting that while our company's have a strong foundation for ensuring GDPR compliance and protecting client data, the client's specific requirements should be carefully reviewed and addressed through contractual agreements and service level agreements (SLAs) that outline our company's commitments to confidentiality, data protection, and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the handling and review of a client file, the solution must surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review (e.g. during the révision des comptes). the solution must support the preparation of recurring documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

