    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Offer regular training and support to the client on legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents, ensuring the client are equipped to meet legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents using our platform's." ;
