    <http://example.org/node/chunk163> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity and the quality and reliability of work. an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity and the quality and reliability of work must provide an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the firm's professionals' work environment, supporting the firm's professionals' in the firm's professionals' daily activities." ;
