    <http://example.org/node/chunk164> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the firm's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs as of 2024, what AI components would you propose to meet these requirements and are there any potential innovation risks or limitations?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client requirements for an artificial-intelligence assistance solution that improves productivity and quality of work, you propose leveraging the firm's Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities. leveraging will enable the generation of answers grounded in validated material such as accounting standards, tax doctrine, and internal procedures, thereby limiting unsupported generation and enhancing reliability. the firm's platform, Atelier, can be utilized to develop a hybrid retrieval system that combines lexical and semantic search, allowing for more accurate and context-specific information retrieval." ;
