        ex:hasText "Given the client's constraints, particularly those related to data sovereignty, confidentiality, and professional secrecy, the firm's sovereign European open-weight model (self-hosted) would be an appropriate choice. our sovereign European open-weight model (self-hosted) provides full auditability and is well-suited for reliability-driven and sovereignty-driven requirements, albeit with somewhat lower raw performance on complex tasks compared to top-tier proprietary models." ;
